=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Fari-Wari} at the Shararat Teahouse (K-12) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
* Head to {z:Mount Zhayolm} and click on **Sprightly Footsteps** (L-7) between 18:00-06:00.
** VW Teleport will take you to the exact location.
** Casting {s:Escape} from inside {z:Halvung} puts you at (L-7) just north of the location.
** Be aware that starting this cutscene after 05:00 will not allow you enough time to read the dialogue at a normal speed and start the next cutscene before the hour changes.
* Click on on **Withered Petals** (L-6, southeast portion near the coastal cliffs) between 18:00-06:00.
** After the cutscene you'll end up in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}.
* Trade a {i:Hydrangea|Hydrangea|2729} to {n:Fari-Wari}.
** {i:Hydrangea|Hydrangea|2729} is dropped by {m:Hilltroll Red Mage}, {m:Hilltroll Warrior}, and {m:Hilltroll Puppetmaster} in {z:Mount Zhayolm}.
** You can also buy it from Auction House
* Trade the {i:Hydrangea|Hydrangea|2729} to the **Withered Petals** in {z:Mount Zhayolm}.
** Does not have to be at night.
* Return to {n:Fari-Wari} for a cutscene and an {i:Imperial Gold Piece|Imperial Gold Piece|2187}.
* Speak to {n:Fari-Wari} after this to learn {p:Trust} Gadalar.
* Speak to {n:Fari-Wari} after the day changes to receive a {i:Mercenary Camp Entry Slip|M. Camp Entry|2487}.

